      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要让我说几遍啊！\n我的阿柏怪是天下最强的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6089818BA962118BF451E0904D554AFF01000A62117684963F67CF602A662F59294E0B67005F3A7684FF01001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不就是花纹吗？\n冰鬼护这张脸要绝上一万倍！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D5C31662F82B17EB95417FF1F000A51B09B3C62A48FD95F20813889817EDD4E0A4E004E07500DFF01001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "干嘛？你看什么看！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E72561BFF1F4F60770B4EC04E48770BFF01001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你这家伙！给我过来帮忙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608FD95BB64F19FF017ED962118FC767655E2E5FD9FF01001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很简单，\n只要做我们的对手就行了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F887B805355FF0C000A53EA8981505A62114EEC76845BF9624B5C31884C4E863002001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "首先让我的阿柏怪\n和你的宝可梦1打1。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "999651488BA962117684963F67CF602A000A548C4F6076845B9D53EF68A60031625300313002001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然后再让那家伙的\n冰鬼护和你的宝可梦1打1。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136540E518D8BA990A35BB64F197684000A51B09B3C62A4548C4F6076845B9D53EF68A60031625300313002001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就这么定了！你来当我们的标尺，\n跟你对战就能知道谁更强了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C318FD94E485B9A4E86FF014F6067655F5362114EEC768468075C3AFF0C000A8DDF4F605BF962185C3180FD77E590538C0166F45F3A4E863002001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的阿柏怪先上！\n1打1，来单挑吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684963F67CF602A51484E0AFF01000A003162530031FF0C6765535563115427FF01001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会赢的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A8D6276840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还没准备好",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD86CA151C65907597D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "赶紧的！\n选1只你喜欢的宝可梦打过来吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D767D277684FF01000A9009003153EA4F60559C6B2276845B9D53EF68A662538FC767655427FF01001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我只有1只阿柏怪，\n你也只能带1只同行宝可梦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EA6709003153EA963F67CF602AFF0C000A4F604E5F53EA80FD5E26003153EA540C884C5B9D53EF68A6FF01001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "赶紧输给我！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D767D278F937ED96211FF01001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我来欣赏一下\n这家伙打输的样子！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167656B238D4F4E004E0B000A8FD95BB64F1962538F93768468375B50FF01001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的阿柏怪……竟然输了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684963F67CF602A202620267ADF71368F934E8620262026001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "活该呀！\n果然我的冰鬼护才是最强的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D3B8BE55440FF01000A679C71366211768451B09B3C62A4624D662F67005F3A7684FF01001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接下来跟我的冰鬼护单挑吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A54E0B67658DDF6211768451B09B3C62A4535563115427FF01001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接下来是跟我的冰鬼护对战！\n当然是1打1的单挑！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A54E0B6765662F8DDF6211768451B09B3C62A45BF96218FF01000A5F537136662F003162530031768453556311FF01001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会赢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A8D620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还没准备好",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD86CA151C65907597D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦～也就是说\n你承认我的冰鬼护是最强的咯。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E6FF5E4E5F5C31662F8BF4000A4F60627F8BA46211768451B09B3C62A4662F67005F3A768454AF3002001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "1打1哦，你懂不懂啊？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00316253003154E6FF0C4F6061C24E0D61C2554AFF1F001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好嘞，看我怎么收拾你！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D561EFF0C770B6211600E4E48653662FE4F60FF01001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可恶……\n你到底是什么来头……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF607620262026000A4F6052305E95662F4EC04E486765593420262026001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "连我的冰鬼护……\n也不是对手……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FDE6211768451B09B3C62A420262026000A4E5F4E0D662F5BF9624B20262026001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "结果我们俩都输了啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ED3679C62114EEC4FE990FD8F934E86554AFF01001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的阿柏怪也好，\n你的冰鬼护也好，都不是最强的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684963F67CF602A4E5F597DFF0C000A4F60768451B09B3C62A44E5F597DFF0C90FD4E0D662F67005F3A76843002001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊！最强的是那家伙的搭档，\n<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554AFF0167005F3A7684662F90A35BB64F197684642D6863FF0C000A0010000201010002FF01001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说的没错。\n我们只不过是井底的蚊香蛙皇而已……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF476846CA195193002000A62114EEC53EA4E0D8FC7662F4E955E957684868A999986D97687800C5DF220262026001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多亏了你，\n我们看到该努力的方向啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A4E8F4E864F60FF0C000A62114EEC770B52308BE552AA529B768465B954115566FF01001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错！通往天下最强的道路，\n我会走在这家伙的冰鬼护前面的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF01901A5F8059294E0B67005F3A768490538DEFFF0C000A62114F1A8D7057288FD95BB64F19768451B09B3C62A4524D97627684FF01001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你傻啊！休想超过我！\n我俩还没分出胜负，要继续较量！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6050BB554AFF014F1160F38D858FC76211FF01000A62114FE98FD86CA1520651FA80DC8D1FFF0C89817EE77EED8F8391CFFF01001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
